# Local visual/screenshot scratch drivers (Playwright) — not part of the suite
frontend/tests/visual/

# Claude Code tooling + instructions. Most .claude state is machine-local (jobs,
# worktrees, local settings) and stays out of git; the issei agents + skills ARE shared
# so the review/docs gates work from a fresh clone. CLAUDE.md is committed too (project
# guide). Memory files (~/.claude/projects/.../memory) stay OUT — they hold candid notes.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/

# Brainstorming visual companion + agentic scratch
.superpowers/

# Vitest's own cache, written at the REPO ROOT rather than under frontend/ — so it escapes
# frontend/.gitignore and a `git add -A` would have committed it. Caught by the ship gate.
.vite/
